      "locked": false,
      "text": "Reads the first two args if they starts with \"--\"\nthen check if they belong to the strategies enums\nOR\nif its a benchmark flag\n\nIf there were any issues it will return -1 as an error flag.\nElse return founded flags that's being stored in t_parsed node.",
